e="package" accept=".zip" required></label><label><?=e(t('Mot de passe actuel','Current password'))?><input name="current_password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required></label></div><button class="button primary"><?=e(t('Déposer en quarantaine pour examen','Quarantine for review'))?></button></form><p class="hint"><?=e(t('Exemples et documentation dans le dossier sdk du pack. Les thèmes et extensions WordPress ne s’installent pas directement.','Examples and documentation are in the SDK folder. WordPress themes and plugins cannot be installed directly.'))?></p></details>
